Archie is a human member of the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]] and the party's driver. He wears leather armor under a dark cloak and carries a bandolier of daggers across his chest, with a rapier at his side. He is a master of moving unheard.

Before he joined the Velvet Mark, Archie was an Undercrofter of [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/index|Iomenei]]. There he fought the [[Bestiary/Vermin|Hivemother]] and its swarm in a forsaken sector of the city beside [[People/Barlow Crane|Barlow Crane]], [[People/Grant FireEye|Grant FireEye]] and [[People/Gage|Gage]], then left the city. He is trained in first aid.
